OL,3,AFlight chaos caused by 'millisecond'
OL,4,Asoftware defect, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,7,Fcalled the disruption "completely
OL,8,Funacceptable", while industry body
OL,9,FAirlines UK is writing to Nats to
OL,10,Fdemand immediate compensation for costs
OL,11,Fincurred.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
